Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:44:28 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20remove=20residues=20of=20deleted=20featu?=
 =?UTF-8?q?res=20=E2=80=94=20pairing=20and=20acp=20tests,=20Claude=20Agent?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20SDK,=20pairing=20QR?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Completes the total deletion of the earlier patches. The server pairing tests and the cross-site pairing assertion tested endpoints patch 0001 deleted; the CLI auth test still invoked the deleted acp command and the import-boundary suite still guarded the deleted acp tree; the TUI keybind test still expected the deleted server.pair command; the QR encoder in @opencode/util (with the jsqr decoder dependency and its test) served only pairing and had no remaining importers. In core, the Claude Agent provider plugin deleted by patch 0005 left its SDK behind: the #claude-agent-sdk imports entry (both targets deleted), the dev/peer dependency declarations, the build external, and the package itself in bun.lock — all removed; nothing imported the SDK anymore.
---
 bun.lock                                    | 168 +---------
 packages/cli/test/auth.test.ts              |   7 +-
 packages/cli/test/import-boundaries.test.ts |  10 -
 packages/core/package.json                  |  13 -
 packages/core/script/build.ts               |   1 -
 packages/server/test/process.test.ts        |  62 ----
 packages/server/test/request-site.test.ts   |   3 +-
 packages/tui/test/config-v2.test.tsx        |   1 -
 packages/util/package.json                  |   3 +-
 packages/util/src/qr.ts                     | 323 --------------------
 packages/util/test/qr.test.ts               | 113 -------
 11 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 699 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 packages/util/src/qr.ts
 delete mode 100644 packages/util/test/qr.test.ts

